  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## No-Show Shield 4: first-come slot claim page\nThe link in the waitlist offer lands here. The first valid tap books the slot for that client; later taps see a polite \"already taken\" page. The owner is emailed.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with tabs Bookings, Waitlist and Report using the CSV headers in the sheet-templates folder; paste its ID into the Config node (sheetId).\n2. Fill in the Config node: business name, owner email, time zone offset (for example -05:00), channel (sms or email) and your own Stripe/PayPal payment link.\n3. Attach credentials on nodes with a warning icon: Google Sheets OAuth2, SMTP, and Twilio (HTTP Basic Auth: Account SID / Auth Token) if you use SMS.\n4. Execute once with test rows, then activate.\n5. Set this Webhook node to respond via the Respond to Webhook nodes (already configured).",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
